  "body": "Our vendors are committed to selling, making this a genuine opportunity for buyers looking to secure a prime Cliff Road position and create something special.\r\n\r\nDesigned by Fairhead Sang Carnahan, this distinctive 1980s coastal development enjoys an exceptional waterfront setting, with strong concrete forms, generous glazing, angled elements and balconies designed to embrace the views.\r\n\r\nThe apartment is ready for a refresh, offering exciting potential to add value and transform it into a stylish St Heliers home. Generous windows capture natural light and the spectacular outlook, while the outdoor living area provides an easy connection with the coastal surroundings.\r\n\r\nSolid concrete-block construction and a tiled roof add to the building's enduring architectural appeal, while the location is simply hard to beat. St Heliers village, cafés, restaurants, the beach and coastal walkway are all within easy reach.\r\n\r\nImportantly, the current CV should not be relied upon as an indication of value. With our vendors committed to selling, this is an opportunity where buyers should take a serious look, assess the potential and put forward their best offer.\r\n\r\nExceptional views. Genuine architectural character. A prime Cliff Road address. And a property that will be sold.\r\n\r\nIf you've been waiting for an opportunity to secure a foothold in this tightly held coastal location, this is one to inspect.\r\n\r\nFor open homes, please come to the Cliff Road entrance.",
